# CUSTOM PATCH: ignore list for docker/images/n8n/Dockerfile.custom only.
# BuildKit reads "<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore" before the root .dockerignore.
# The root file is a whitelist for the prebuilt-compiled flow and blocks the
# source tree. This build needs the source tree, so it has its own blocklist.
# Every pattern has a "**/" prefix: a bare name matches only at the context root.

# Secrets and agent or editor state. Never in a build context.
**/.env*
**/*.local
**/.claude
**/.remember
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.git

# Host build output. The image rebuilds all of it. Stale output can break the build.
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/dist
compiled
build-manifest.json
docker-build-manifest.json
.agent-setup

# Local logs and scratch files.
**/*.log

# Docs that the build does not read.
v1-docs
v2-docs

# Keep tracked test fixtures that ship their own dist folders.
# No env file is re-included, not even the *.example files. The build does not read them.
!packages/quality/testing/playwright/fixtures/**
